submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "run_log": "/workspace/output/run.jsonl"
  }
}
```

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/run.jsonl`:
JSONL, one record per equilibration sample, with increasing elapsed time in fs and temperature in K.
```text
{"type":"sample","phase":"equilibration","time_fs":2000.0,"temperature_K":300.0}
```
